    {
      "description": "p95 and p99 read from the histogram the API already exports (management.metrics.distribution.percentiles-histogram.http.server.requests=true). Both quantiles are computed per job from the aggregated buckets: averaging a per-instance quantile would be wrong, and summing `le` across instances is what histogram_quantile expects. The gateway does not export the histogram, so it appears here only once it does.",
